WEBVTT

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.360
Ryuuki...

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:41.900
Shuuei-nii-sama's gone, Shusui-san is missing, and Shuurei-chan isn't around,

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:42.910
so you're lonely, aren't you?

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:45.540
Yeah.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:58.420
I'm glad. Ryuuki can express his feelings to Jyuusan-hime.

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:04.090
Even if I'm not around, he won't have to spend his nights alone.

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:07.660
He doesn't have to feel lonely.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:34.010
You've become small, like a quail's egg.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:40.910
I'm not crying, though.

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.210
Yeah?

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.450
Ensei, please forgo the National Exam this year,

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:59.180
and come with me to Ranshuu.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.700
Sure.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:02.680
What?

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.660
"Sure"? Did you really understand what I said, Ensei?

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.900
I didn't come here to take the National Exam

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.070
because I was desperate to be an official of the central government.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.880
Then why did you want to take the National Exam?

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.440
Didn't you come here to help Yuushun-san?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.420
Yuushun doesn't need me.

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.870
Not now, at least.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:24.760
But Princess...

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.110
I need you.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.860
Even so, you can finally take the National Exam—

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.080
"Thanks, Ensei, I'm so happy!"

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.590
"You're superb!"

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:39.610
Right?

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.420
I won't give you a second chance.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.480
What do you say?

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.740
Do you want me or not?

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:53.250
Then, if you're okay with it, take this.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:00.040
A letter of appointment to the
Section of Government Inspection,

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.510
properly stamped with the Director General's seal.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.030
That's sneaky, Princess.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.860
You're not gonna ask me properly?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:14.520
Please come with me.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.400
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.720
By the way, Princess, you haven't slept much, have you?

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.430
Umm, Ensei, that's...

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.650
I thought so.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:28.440
Honestly, can't Seiran just force you to sleep?

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.540
He's way too soft on you.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.080
I told you that your health is your most precious asset!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:47.040
This was inevitable. Don't get angry at me, Seiran.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.000
I'm going to kill you.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.770
I heard you were summoned by the Director General of the Section of Government Inspection.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.480
Impressive. You've got sharp ears.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:05.250
Didn't Ki Kouki-dono recruit you to work directly under him?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.420
He did.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.200
I declined, though.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:13.930
After all, my direction's already been decided.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.350
I have no intention of working for anyone else.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:21.290
Come on, you set it up. Why are you looking so sour about it?

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.980
It's a conditioned reflex.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.840
You'll be closer to her than ever. Just the thought of that makes me like this.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:32.850
Ensei, whatever happens, bring oujo-sama back safely from Ranshuu.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:39.470
Hey, Seiran, once I said that you and
Princess should become husband and wife,

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.770
but I take it back.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.400
What do you mean by that?!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:48.730
Don't just stand and watch when your
precious woman is left all alone, you idiot.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:53.360
Anyway, leaving the Emperor aside, don't give way to me.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.660
You're too optimistic.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.750
You never know what's gonna happen in life, you know.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.110
Master?

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.530
Why?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.990
Please take care of the Emperor.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.370
Sure, leave him to me.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.280
Have a pleasant journey, my lord.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:44.130
Please come back safely.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.840
Well then, let's go.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:06.650
What?

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.470
Don't make me repeat confidential information.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:13.310
The Emperor took Jyuusan-hime with him to pay an incognito visit to Ranshuu.

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:16.490
On top of that, he didn't even take a single soldier with him.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.620
Your mission is to go and bring the Emperor back safely.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:24.270
Did you order me to wait because you knew this was going to happen?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.630
Who knows?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:30.630
Also, I hear that he didn't reveal the reason for his visit.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.340
I understand. I'll depart now.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.470
While you're there, investigate this man.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.190
Shiba Jin.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.070
He was the eldest son of the Shiba family, the leading clan serving the Ran family.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:44.680
Much was expected from him, but five years ago,

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:48.110
when Shiba Jin was 21 years old, he murdered his father.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:53.590
Even a son of the distinguished, noble Shiba family cannot escape capital punishment for that crime.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.160
Not even if he was the fiancée of Jyuusan-hime.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.640
Why is he important?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.800
If it happened five years ago,
he should've been executed long ago.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.450
You're talking nonsense.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:06.960
Weren't you the one who investigated the "ghosts of the prison dead"?

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:16.970
Someone was choosing skilled condemned convicts and turning them into assassins.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.470
It fits Shiba Jin's profile perfectly, don't you think?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.600
That's...

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.550
If there's even the slightest possibility that he's alive, it would be a serious matter.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:29.240
Who let him escape, and was the Ran family involved?

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.070
If they were?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:35.000
Then we can drag the Ran family out into the open.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:40.610
If they're connected to the attempted assassination of Jyuusan-hime, the Emperor's intended wife,

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:43.330
then we can impose death sentences on the conspirators.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:48.800
It's about time we tightened control over the Kou and Ran families.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:53.180
Those two families have a tendency to use their wealth and power

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:56.050
to bend the law and do as they please.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:59.450
This is the case you've been investigating all along,

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.060
so be sure to do a proper job while you search for the Emperor.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.770
Yes, sir. I'm leaving now.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.940
I don't mind if you don't come back.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.840
In fact, don't come back.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.940
I will definitely come back!

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.200
What would you like as a souvenir from Ranshuu?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.450
Bring me indigo duck eggs, the local speciality of Ranshuu.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.560
Duck eggs?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:24.450
The eggs are pickled in mud mixed with salt.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.150
They go well with sake.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:28.460
So make yourself useful by pickling some eggs and bring them to me.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.050
Umm, Director General, I'm going there to work.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.850
I don't have time to make pickles.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:39.630
Also, there are mushrooms that look like a monkey's head, known as monkey-head mushrooms.

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.090
Gather some from the mountains.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.720
Don't bother coming back until you find them.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.130
One last thing.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.860
If the Emperor enters Kyuusai Cove, don't follow him.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.450
Kyuusai Cove?

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.840
You'll find out what kind of place it is when you get there.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:57.690
I repeat, don't follow him.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:01.270
This is an order. If you disobey, you'll be fired.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:08.000
Ryuuki... I must leave as soon as possible.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:38.320
Hey, Princess, what about Shouka-san and Seiran?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.540
I left a note.

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.530
I wanted to see them before I left, though.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.790
It's a shame, but we didn't have time.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.160
I'm sorry about this, Tan-tan. It happened so suddenly.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.710
Well, I was kind of expecting it.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.540
No! Go faster, Ensei!

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:55.380
What?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.210
Hurry!

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.570
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry up!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.220
SUOU!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.800
I've come to see you off!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.590
Ensei, stop!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.330
I've made a lot of rice balls for you.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.330
Share them with your colleagues.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:18.450
Travel is tiring, so I've added extra salt and some pickled plum as well.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:21.750
Oh, and your mother made some omelets.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:26.790
I owe you so much.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.540
Oh no, not at all. I owe you too.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.920
All right, great, thanks!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.880
Will you please go home, Dad?

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:39.920
Your father is really proud that you're even going to Ranshuu for work.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.950
I'm going to work hard while you're away,

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.580
so I can pay back, no matter how little,

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:47.430
the money we borrowed from Shuurei-san to pay the indemnity.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.180
Your mother is in hiding, but she'll see you off somewhere too.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.210
When I was leaving, she wasn't in her room.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:01.320
Please take care of my son, and have a safe journey.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.520
Thank you.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.570
We're off now.

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:10.750
You've got a nice dad.

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:12.750
Hmm?

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.250
So, let's go to Ranshuu!

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.030
Ranshuu, huh... It's been a while.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.670
I didn't imagine that I'd come back here again.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.630
Are you all right, Shusui?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.410
Just about...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:51.090
Is there no way at all to undo that curse of yours?

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:56.540
Isn't it easier to use me if the curse can't be undone?

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:01.690
I don't want a subordinate who ignores my orders and picks fights whenever she pleases.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:07.370
Anyway, I don't work under the Hyou family, yet they order me around.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.800
They told me to send you to Kyuusai Cove.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.810
Kyuusai Cove...

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:16.860
In ancient times, Emperor Sou Gen, together with his sister Sou Youki,

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:21.810
defeated 108 monsters and sealed them in a treasure mirror.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:24.170
However, the mirror could not withstand this and shattered into fragments.

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:29.640
At that moment, Sou Youki played her erhu.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:33.290
The fragments of the smashed mirror turned into lakes one after the other.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:38.970
The monsters that were about to emerge from the fragments were sealed in each lake.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:45.130
That same Sou Youki is the founder of the Hyou family.

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:48.460
Why did you agree to come?

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:52.160
Because as long as I have this curse, it doesn't matter where I go.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:57.640
If Ruka-sama wishes me to go to Kyuusai Cove, then I'll end up there one way or another.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:02.900
Therefore, I'll go there of my own free will, instead of being forced.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.770
We're in Kyuusai Cove.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.920
Hey...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.450
Are you all right?

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.040
Ruka-sama is here.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:31.970
Hey...

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:38.480
Please... if I... in that case...

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.260
kill me...

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:48.130
Ran Shuuei was heading to Kyuusai Cove as well.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:55.980
Few people know that the Ran family's main residence is not situated in Gyokuryuu,

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.410
the capital city of Ranshuu, but in Kyuusai Cove.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.670
Shuu-aniue, you've arrived.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.270
I'm home, Ryuuren.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:06.920
Yeah.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.420
Welcome home.

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.880
Ryuuren said, "Welcome home"?

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.310
He must've been strictly trained by Shuurei-dono and Eigetsu-kun.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.340
I don't see your iris sword.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:20.060
Ah, I returned it.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.020
Ryuuren, don't do anything, will you?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.780
This is my problem.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:28.940
Fine, if Shuu-aniue says so.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.550
By the way, Setsu-aniue is not home.

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.760
Gyokuka-aneue is, however.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:38.040
Where are you going, my foolish brother?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.260
I-I'll come back in 200 years.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.210
You can sort this problem out for me. I've changed my mind!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.500
I'm counting on you, my little brother!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.040
This is shameful, my foolish brother!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.020
Can't you be courageous and face it once and for all?

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:52.340
If you need help that badly, I'll play you an improvised piece to scrap your courage right now.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.440
You mean screw up my courage?

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:59.990
Even if it rains spears, piglets, or pandas, I'm going back! No matter what!

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:02.520
Oh, you're leaving?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:11.940
Welcome home, Shuuei-san.

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.320
Gyokuka-aneue...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.580
The greatness of nature is calling for the sound of my flute.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.430
I'll remember this, Ryuuren.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:32.590
When I get a chance, I'll tell Shuurei-dono and Eigetsu-kun all your little secrets.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.690
Nothing's changed here.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:53.280
What's the point of staying in the house on such a lovely day?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.180
Shuuei-san, come with me as my bodyguard.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:05.500
I'm susceptible to freckles, but I prefer to be in the sun, so it can't be helped.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.730
Shuuei-san, breakfast is ready.

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.600
Please enjoy your meal.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.810
Sister's sweet omelet.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:35.400
Shuuei-san once praised me, saying I'm soft like an omelet.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.180
You remembered?

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:41.780
Oh, but didn't Setsu-aniue say the same thing?

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:47.010
They were the same words, but in
Setsuna-san's case, he snorted and said,

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:52.300
"Father's new lover is like an omelet: quite plain."

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:55.300
Th-That's how they met, the two loves of each other's lives?

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:58.350
I was so upset that I promised myself,

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:01.950
"As one of the new mothers of Setsuna-san and his brothers,

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:05.770
I will be strong and not be bullied by my sons."

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.980
Do-or-die resistance!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:11.980
But in the end, instead of becoming
Setsu-aniue's mother, you became his wife.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:12.980
Didn't you, sister?

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:17.770
That's right. We were always arguing. It's so strange...

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:20.280
We especially argued about you.

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:22.550
What? About me?

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:24.210
Wh-Why?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:28.290
Whenever I went out with you, he got furious.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.420
"Don't make Shuuei one of your victims."

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.320
"Stop dragging him around. He's still young."

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:37.170
"If you were going to do that, why didn't you ask me?"

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:39.180
That's...

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:42.140
Whenever I saw him, he was sarcastic.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.430
Of course it was more fun to be with you.

00:18:46.110 --> 00:18:48.940
Setsu-aniue was jealous?

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:51.700
There's more.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:57.840
Only she can turn that brother of mine into an ordinary man.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.700
What's so funny, Shuuei-san?

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.770
Nothing.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:09.710
My brother struggled hard, seized his chance, and finally made this woman his wife.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.800
Sister, are you happy?

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.670
This is a secret.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.180
If Setsuna-san and the others hear about it,
they'll be full of themselves.

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.530
I'm happy.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.060
I lost to my brother.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.060
That's fine.

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:42.220
In that case, it couldn't be helped.

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:51.650
Did you find someone you really care about?

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:52.710
What?

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.450
It shows on your face.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:58.380
Is she the owner of this fan?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.380
It's a beautiful fan.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:06.890
I imagine she must be as beautiful as this fan.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.520
She is,

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.810
though I only seem to upset her.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:15.400
Well, well, in that case, you've got to try very hard.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.010
Yes, and I mean to.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.420
That's why I came back.

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:24.220
I have all the records you asked for in your letter.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:27.160
If there's anything else you need, please feel free to ask.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.740
Then one question.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.960
Has someone entered the the Hyou family's shrine as a shrine maiden?

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:37.160
Yes, Setsuna-san isn't here because he went to greet her.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:39.380
Brother went himself?

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:45.380
So she's the head of the Hyou family, or someone in an equivalent position.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:50.230
Did Setsu-aniue leave a message?

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:53.420
Yes, he said he has no intention of seeing you.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.100
I'll wait.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:21:01.810
Sister, please tell me all the news you receive from Kiyou.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:04.490
Especially any news about Kou Shuurei and the Emperor.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.360
Yes, I will.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.990
Setsuna-san and the others are tough. Do your best.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.840
T-Tan-tan, are you all right?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:28.090
How come you two are fine?

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:32.080
Can't we help him somehow?

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:34.390
He hasn't eaten at all.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:38.900
Well then, I'll show you how dependable I am in situations like this!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:46.090
E-Ensei!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.510
It's better if he sleeps.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:53.620
He'll be saving energy, so he can survive on very little food.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.910
I call it "Operation Winter Bear."

00:21:57.340 --> 00:22:00.810
Like this, he won't fall into the river and...

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:01.920
Huh?

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.920
Why are they throwing away the dumplings?!

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.190
What a waste!

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:08.300
Stop it, Ensei! Don't be an idiot!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.470
The water is suddenly flowing faster.

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:18.730
This area's always been difficult for sailing, and many people died here.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:25.050
In the past, we used to offer human sacrifices to the river god to ask for calm water, but...

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:29.070
A couple of decades ago, an undercover inspector said,

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:33.910
"Sacrificing people is nonsense. Dumplings will do."

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:36.070
He threw a dumpling he was eating into the river.

00:22:36.070 --> 00:22:38.420
Then the waves disappeared...

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:42.670
Wow.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.030
After that, people in this area stopped the practice of human sacrifice,

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:48.730
and started throwing human-shaped dumplings into the river.

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:50.820
Impressive.

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:53.680
Umm, do you know the name of the inspector?

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:54.930
His name?

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:57.310
I don't know that.

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:08.150
Here comes the worst part!

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:13.130
Princess, hold on tight!

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:13.910
I will.

00:24:45.270 --> 00:24:47.370
Oh no! Tan-tan fell into the river!

00:24:47.370 --> 00:24:48.600
Someone please rescue him!

00:24:48.600 --> 00:24:51.210
What? He's fine because he was tied to a rope?

00:24:51.210 --> 00:24:52.090
Oh, you're right!

00:24:52.090 --> 00:24:53.870
He's being pulled by the ship.

00:24:53.870 --> 00:24:57.510
Well, we're about to arrive in Gyokuryuu, the capital of Ranshuu!
